    "mathematics": "Enumerate coordinate sums s=m+n from 2 through 24, taking rows in descending order on each anti-diagonal. Sums 2 through 13 contain 1+2+...+12=78 cells; sums 14 and 15 contain 11 and 10 cells, ending at 99. The fifth cell for s=16 is (12,4),(11,5),(10,6),(9,7),(8,8), with values 100 through 104. Exhaustive generation yields each integer 1 through 144 exactly once and matches the diagram's 139 through 144 corner values."
